// A school year as Persona keeps one: four slots a day, a seven-day week, a deadline, and a friend who asks on
// Sunday evenings. The calendar keeps its facts; the story only reads them.
cast:
  ryuji  "Ryuji"
facts (time):
  turn:  int   (clock)

== school (calendar)
  [clock turn] [scope time]
= slot
  [size 1] [place slot] [names morning, noon, afternoon, evening]
= day
  [size 4] [count day]
= week
  [cycle day] [place weekday] [names monday, tuesday, wednesday, thursday, friday, saturday, sunday]
= days_left
  [until day 34] [per day]

== ramen
  [every week] [at sunday evening] [times 5]
{ weekday = sunday and slot = evening } RYUJI: yo. ramen?
-> end
